       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.           TFRTERR.
       AUTHOR.               KALMAN.
       DATE-WRITTEN.         OCT 1993.
      *INSTALLATION.         GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.

      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*
      *D*     THIS PROGRAM WILL READ THE MBR CALLED DAILYERR
      *D*     IN FILE FRTERRFL AND WRITE A REPORT. THE CL WILL THEN
      *D*     ADD THE ERRORS TO THE MBR FRTERRFL AND CLEAR DAILYERR.
      *D*
      *C* CHANGES.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

      ******************************************************************
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE-CONTROL.

           SELECT ERROR-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-FRTERRFL
                  ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                  ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT ONLINE-PRT
                  ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.

      ******************************************************************
       DATA DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ERROR-I.
       01  ERROR-REC-I                PIC X(191).

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           DATA RECORD IS PRT-REC
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  PRT-REC                       PIC X(133).

      ******************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      ******************************************************************
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  Q C M D E X C   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  M I S C E L L A N E O U S   D A T E   &   T I M E   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  CUR-DATE.
           05  CUR-DATE-CC                PIC X(2).
           05  CUR-SYSTEM-DATE.
               10  CUR-DATE-YY            PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DATE-MM            PIC X(2).
               10  CUR-DATE-DD            PIC X(2).

       01  CUR-TIME                       PIC X(6).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A R G U M E N T   V A L U E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  F L A G S   A N D   S W I T C H E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  ERROR-EOF                PIC X.

       01  ERRORS-FOUND             PIC X.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  I N D E X E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  A C C U M U L A T O R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  S A V E   F I E L D S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  T A B L E S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  P R I N T   L I N E   B U F F E R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  RPT-HDR-1.
           05                      PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(10)  VALUE "   TFRTERR".
           05                      PIC X(34).
           05                      PIC X(34)
               VALUE "CORPORATE STORES ACCOUNTING SYSTEM".
           05                      PIC X(35).
           05                      PIC X(6)  VALUE "DATE  ".
           05  H1-MM               PIC X(2).
           05                      PIC X     VALUE "-".
           05  H1-DD               PIC X(2).
           05                      PIC X     VALUE "-".
           05  H1-YYYY             PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(3).

       01  RPT-HDR-2.
           05                      PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(8)  VALUE "   PAGE ".
           05  H2-PG               PIC 99.
           05                      PIC X(36).
           05                      PIC X(31)
               VALUE "FREIGHT PROCESSING ERROR REPORT".
           05                      PIC X(36).
           05                      PIC X(8)  VALUE "TIME    ".
           05  H2-HH               PIC X(2).
           05                      PIC X     VALUE ":".
           05  H2-MM               PIC X(2).
           05                      PIC X     VALUE ":".
           05  H2-SS               PIC X(2).
           05                      PIC X(3).

       01  COL-HDR-1.
           05                      PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(3).
           05                      PIC X(4) VALUE "TYPE".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(4) VALUE "MODE".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(4) VALUE "CARR".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(16) VALUE "PRO NUMBER      ".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(10) VALUE "SHIP  DATE".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(10) VALUE "VEHICLE NO".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(10) VALUE "PAID  DATE".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(15) VALUE "PURCHASE  ORDER".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(12) VALUE "  FRT CHARGE".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(5)  VALUE "TERMS".
           05                      PIC X(3).

       01  COL-HDR-U.
           05                      PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(3).
           05                      PIC X(4) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(4) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(4) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(16) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(10) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(10) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(10) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(15) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(12) VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(5)  VALUE ALL "-".
           05                      PIC X(3).

       01  DTL-1.
           05                      PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(3).
           05  D1-TYPE             PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(5).
           05  D1-MODE             PIC X(2).
           05                      PIC X(5).
           05  D1-CARR             PIC X(4).
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05  D1-PRO              PIC X(16).
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05  D1-SHIP             PIC X(10).
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05  D1-VEH              PIC X(10).
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05  D1-PAID             PIC X(10).
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05  D1-PO               PIC X(15).
           05                      PIC X(4).
           05  D1-AMT              PIC Z,ZZZ,ZZ9.99.
           05                      PIC X(6).
           05  D1-TERMS            PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(5).
       01  DTL-2.
           05                      PIC X(1).
           05                      PIC X(11).
           05  D2-MSG              PIC X(121).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T A B A S E   A N D   F I L E   B U F F E R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  BUF-ERROR.
           05  ERR-RECORD                     PIC X(130).
           05  ERR-CODE                       PIC X(3).
           05  ERR-MSG                        PIC X(50).
           05  ERR-DATE                       PIC X(8).

       COPY FREIGHT  OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  D A T A B A S E   S T A T U S   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X.

      *COPY DBCSACCT OF COPYLIB.

      *COPY DATAB    OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *  U T I L I T Y   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.

      *COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYLIB.

      ******************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      ******************************************************************

       00-CONTROL.

           PERFORM 10-HSK.

           PERFORM 60-WRITE-REPORT THRU 60-EXIT.

           PERFORM 20-EOJ.

           GOBACK.

       10-HSK.

           OPEN INPUT      ERROR-I.
           OPEN OUTPUT     ONLINE-PRT.

           ACCEPT CUR-TIME FROM TIME.

      *----AS OF MAR 93 THE CENTURY IS NOT AVAILABLE FROM THE SYSTEM.
      *----UNTIL THE SITUATION CHANGES, THE FOLLOWING CODING IS A
      *----TEMPORARY MEASURE. THIS CODING IS USED FOR ALL DATES IN
      *----THIS PROGRAM THAT NEED CONVERSION.

           ACCEPT CUR-SYSTEM-DATE FROM DATE.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY < "40"
              MOVE "20" TO CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
              MOVE "19" TO CUR-DATE-CC.

       20-EOJ.

           CLOSE           ERROR-I  ONLINE-PRT.

       60-WRITE-REPORT.

           READ ERROR-I INTO BUF-ERROR
              AT END GO TO 60-EXIT.

      *----PRINT HEADINGS.
           MOVE CUR-DATE-MM TO H1-MM.
           MOVE CUR-DATE-DD TO H1-DD.
           MOVE CUR-DATE(1:4) TO H1-YYYY.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM RPT-HDR-1.
           MOVE 1 TO H2-PG.
           MOVE CUR-TIME(1:2) TO H2-HH.
           MOVE CUR-TIME(3:2) TO H2-MM.
           MOVE CUR-TIME(5:2) TO H2-SS.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM RPT-HDR-2.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM COL-HDR-1 AFTER ADVANCING 2.
           WRITE PRT-REC FROM COL-HDR-U AFTER ADVANCING 1.

           PERFORM UNTIL ERROR-EOF = "Y"
              MOVE ERR-RECORD           TO  BUF-FREIGHT
              INITIALIZE DTL-1
              MOVE FREIGHT-REC-TYPE     TO  D1-TYPE
              IF D1-TYPE = "P"
                 MOVE "PAID"            TO  D1-TYPE
              END-IF
              IF D1-TYPE = "R"
                 MOVE "RATE"            TO  D1-TYPE
              END-IF
              MOVE FREIGHT-MODE-CODE    TO  D1-MODE
              IF FREIGHT-REC-TYPE = "P"
                 MOVE FREIGHT-PAY-CARR  TO  D1-CARR
              ELSE
                 MOVE FREIGHT-DELV-CARR TO  D1-CARR
              END-IF
              MOVE FREIGHT-FB-NUM       TO  D1-PRO
              IF FREIGHT-SHIP-DATE = SPACES
                 MOVE SPACES TO D1-SHIP
              ELSE
                 STRING FREIGHT-SHIP-MM    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        "-"                DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        FREIGHT-SHIP-DD    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        "-"                DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        FREIGHT-SHIP-YYYY  DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                           INTO D1-SHIP
              END-IF
              MOVE FREIGHT-VEHICLE-NUM  TO  D1-VEH
              IF FREIGHT-PAID-DATE = SPACES
                 MOVE SPACES TO D1-SHIP
              ELSE
                 STRING FREIGHT-PAID-MM    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        "-"                DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        FREIGHT-PAID-DD    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        "-"                DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        FREIGHT-PAID-YYYY  DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                           INTO D1-PAID
              END-IF
              IF FREIGHT-PO-NUM = SPACES
                 MOVE SPACES TO D1-PO
              ELSE
                 STRING FREIGHT-PO-NUM     DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        "-"                DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        FREIGHT-PO-RLS     DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        "-"                DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                        FREIGHT-PO-RCVR    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                                           INTO D1-PO
              END-IF
              MOVE FREIGHT-CHARGES      TO  D1-AMT
              MOVE FREIGHT-TERMS        TO  D1-TERMS

              WRITE PRT-REC FROM DTL-1  AFTER ADVANCING 2

      *-------THE FOLLOWING ERROR CODES ARE WRITTEN TO THE ERROR FILE
      *-------IN TFRTPROC ALONG WITH THE FRT REC IN ERROR

              INITIALIZE DTL-2

              EVALUATE  ERR-CODE
                 WHEN "641"
                    STRING "PREVIOUS PAYMENT FOUND " DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "WITH THE SAME PO AND "   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "PAID DATE"               DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "642"
                    STRING "PREVIOUS PAYMENT FOUND " DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "WITH THE SAME VEHICLE, " DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "SHIP DATE AND PAID DATE" DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "651" THRU "652"
                    STRING "FREIGHT BILL WAS "       DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "PREVIOUSLY RATED WITH "  DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "A NON-ZERO AMOUNT"       DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "761"
                    STRING "FREIGHT BILL TYPE MUST " DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "BE PAID (P) OR RATED "   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "(R)"                     DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "762"
                    STRING "THIS FREIGHT BILL "      DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "OCCURRED BEFORE CSAS "   DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "FREIGHT HAD STARTED "    DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "763"
                    STRING "INVALID CHARACTERS "     DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "FOUND IN FREIGHT AMOUNT" DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "764"
                    STRING "RATED FREIGHT BILLS "    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "FOR NON-RAILROAD "       DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "SHIPMENTS MUST HAVE "    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "A PO/RCVR"               DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
      *----------THE FOLLOWING ERROR CODE WAS COMMENTED OUT OF TFRTPROC
                 WHEN "765"
                    STRING "RATED FREIGHT BILLS "    DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "FOR RAILROAD SHIPMENTS " DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "MUST HAVE VEHICLE NUM "  DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "AND SHIP DATE"           DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "766"
                    STRING "PAID FREIGHT BILLS "     DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "MUST HAVE A PAID DATE"   DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
                 WHEN "767"
                    STRING "PURCHASE ORDER NUMBERS " DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "MUST INCLUDE THE "       DELIMITED BY SIZE,
                           "RECEIVER NUMBER"         DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO D2-MSG
              END-EVALUATE
              IF D2-MSG = SPACES
                 MOVE "UNKNOWN ERROR" TO D2-MSG
              END-IF

              WRITE PRT-REC FROM DTL-2

           READ ERROR-I INTO BUF-ERROR
              AT END MOVE "Y" TO ERROR-EOF
           END-READ

           END-PERFORM.

       60-EXIT. EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *9999-UTILITY SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

      *9999-BLOWUP.
      *    MOVE "TFRTERR" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
      *    CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
      *       VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
      *       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

